{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Classic surf re-imagined in the Godot game engine. Free to play and made for everyone.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/extras/9ea4a537edb9718dd39abd6ef156cdb2.poster.avif?t=1764884500\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/extras/9ea4a537edb9718dd39abd6ef156cdb2.webm?t=1764884500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/extras/9ea4a537edb9718dd39abd6ef156cdb2.mp4?t=1764884500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SurfsUp is a faithful recreation of the community air-surfing that is designed for both veterans and newcomers. Whether you're chasing world records or riding your first ramp, SurfsUp offers precise movement, a competitive feel, and an easy entry point into one of gaming's most iconic experiences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Multiplayer, Your Way</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surf solo or with friends. Join public lobbies or host your own with full control over map selection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Surfing Mechanics</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect your technique in high-speed air-surfing. Ride ramps, carve tight turns, and launch massive jumps with precision and flow. It's all about momentum, timing, and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Daily Map Rotation</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new random set of maps every day keeps sessions fresh and helps you master a wide range of techniques.\u00a0<i>All maps are included with the optional Supporter Bundle.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Classic Surf Maps</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on iconic maps like Utopia, Boreas, Summit, and Mesa, <strong>no unlocks or paywalls.</strong> These community classics are <strong>always available</strong>, letting you sharpen your skills on the maps that helped define the genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Built in Voice Chat</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teach, trash-talk, or just socialize. Voice is fully integrated into every lobby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Global and Friends Only Leaderboards</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete worldwide or with your crew. Every run counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Cosmetic Item Drops</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn tradable player models and surf animations just by playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Supporter Bundle DLC</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An optional upgrade that unlocks all maps, custom lobbies, unique cosmetics, and supports the future of the game's development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/extras/75f9aa60e1492f04cf62bfe7f660b7f3.poster.avif?t=1764884500\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/extras/75f9aa60e1492f04cf62bfe7f660b7f3.webm?t=1764884500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/extras/75f9aa60e1492f04cf62bfe7f660b7f3.mp4?t=1764884500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3454830?t=1764884500","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3454830?t=1764884500","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/57faa0d7ee600f7ebab471d2030169de0961227b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764884500","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/57faa0d7ee600f7ebab471d2030169de0961227b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764884500","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Classic surf re-imagined in the Godot game engine. Free to play and made for everyone.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/extras/9ea4a537edb9718dd39abd6ef156cdb2.poster.avif?t=1764884500\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/extras/9ea4a537edb9718dd39abd6ef156cdb2.webm?t=1764884500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/extras/9ea4a537edb9718dd39abd6