 integrated into every lobby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Global and Friends Only Leaderboards</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete worldwide or with your crew. Every run counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Cosmetic Item Drops</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn tradable player models and surf animations just by playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Supporter Bundle DLC</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An optional upgrade that unlocks all maps, custom lobbies, unique cosmetics, and supports the future of the game's development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/extras/75f9aa60e1492f04cf62bfe7f660b7f3.poster.avif?t=1764884500\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/extras/75f9aa60e1492f04cf62bfe7f660b7f3.webm?t=1764884500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/extras/75f9aa60e1492f04cf62bfe7f660b7f3.mp4?t=1764884500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Mark Arneman","Nerdiful","Carina Arneman"],"dlc":[3469980],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/33175fdd94739e7dadc6a78c68e54486ce5d4fa0/header.jpg?t=1764884500","is_free":true,"linux_requ